    <Question>Include the data you collected during the baseline period and each of the three intervention weeks, on its own page at the end of the handout.</Question>
    <Credit what="baseline_data" pts="1" verdicts="met|absent" codes="absent=MISSING_WEEK_DATA|unclear=MISSING_WEEK_DATA">Baseline week's data present</Credit>
